Z||000010||rogergarrison||05-06-2001||08:15 AM||||Ive seen some TRs and 355 that had bad fitting tops. Even one on EBay, that noted that top didnt fit well. I think your just gonna have to play with it. Most Ferraris, even kits, are NEVER ever driven in rain, so its mostly an 'emergency' top anyway. Be glad - even some REAL exotics dont even have a top. A friend just bought a 94 Viper with 4000 miles and the top is a joke, more like a Tracker bikini top. no back window at all, no side windows.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1234884&a=9116379&p=34556781"> ||||reg||1
